{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33810","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 钓筒 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 钓筒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笼籦截数尺，标置能幽绝。\n从浮笠泽烟，任卧桐江月。\n丝随碧波漫，饵逐清滩发。\n好是趁筒时，秋声正清越。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}